*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.bak

# Runtime state gridlock.py writes next to itself (addon_overrides.json
# comes from the add-on's Configuration tab, the rest is learned/logged
# at runtime) — never part of the template, only ever local state.
# Namespaced per site since v3.0.0 (e.g. gridlock__load_profile.json);
# the un-namespaced names are kept ignored too since they're still read
# once as a migration source for an upgrading single-site install.
load_profile.json
decision_log.json
savings_state.json
savings_history.json
cost_tracking_state.json
addon_overrides.json
*__load_profile.json
*__decision_log.json
*__savings_state.json
*__savings_history.json
*__cost_tracking_state.json
